sequenceDiagram
 actor U as Owner
 participant A as Answer service
 participant P as Live policy
 participant D as Transaction store
 participant R as Rule engine
 U->>A: Answer + expected revision
 A->>P: Check ownership/action
 A->>D: Begin,lock/check revision
 alt Revision matches and answer valid
  A->>R: Applicability and dependency closure
  R-->>A: Active facts + invalidations
  A->>D: Save answer + invalidations + revision;commit
  A-->>U: New revision + changed scope
 else Conflict/invalid
  A->>D: Roll back
  A-->>U: 409/422 with safe repair details
 end
